DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 8174D98
	.string "Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "DEWFORD's GYM LEADER BRAWLY commands\n"
	.string "FIGHTING-type DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "Going against him with NORMAL-type\n"
	.string "DIGIMON is asking for trouble.\p"
	.string "FIGHTING DIGIMON will lay a serious\n"
	.string "smack down on NORMAL DIGIMON,\l"
	.string "so be careful!\p"
	.string "What's worse, the GYM is as dark as\n"
	.string "the ocean floor.\p"
	.string "But it will get brighter after defeating\n"
	.string "the TRAINERS in your way.\p"
	.string "Hey, okay, go for it!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 8174F1E
	.string "Whoah! It's turned too bright in here!\p"
	.string "Your future is bright, too!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_HidekiIntro:: @ 8174F61
	.string "Might is right!\n"
	.string "Come on!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_HidekiDefeat:: @ 8174F7A
	.string "Not enough power...$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_HidekiPostBattle:: @ 8174F8E
	.string "Your skill overcame my strength!\n"
	.string "Your technique is commendable!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TessaIntro:: @ 8174FCE
	.string "There's no need for BRAWLY to be\n"
	.string "involved!\p"
	.string "I'll crush you!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TessaDefeat:: @ 8175009
	.string "But... How?\n"
	.string "How could I lose so easily?$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TessaPostBattle:: @ 8175031
	.string "I'm not going to waste this loss.\n"
	.string "I'll use it to motivate me to train!\p"
	.string "One day I'll become a GYM LEADER...\p"
	.string "No, I'll become the DIGIMON LEAGUE\n"
	.string "CHAMPION!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LauraIntro:: @ 81750C9
	.string "Don't you dare brush me off!\n"
	.string "It's not my fault if you cry!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LauraDefeat:: @ 8175104
	.string "Waaaaaaah!\n"
	.string "I lost!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LauraPostBattle:: @ 8175117
	.string "I battle in the dark to make my heart\n"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "But because it's so dark, I can never\n"
	.string "see BRAWLY's face...$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyIntro:: @ 8175182
	.string "BRAWLY: I guard the KNUCKLE KEY,\n"
	.string "one of eight locks on the way\p"
	.string "home.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyDefeat:: @ 8175246
	.string "BRAWLY: Your bond endured. The\n"
	.string "KNUCKLE KEY now belongs to you.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_ReceivedKnuckleBadge:: @ 81752BB
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 2:\n"
	.string "KNUCKLE!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_KnuckleBadgeInfoTakeThis:: @ 81752E6
	.string "The KNUCKLE KEY restores access\n"
	.string "to FLASH outside battle. Its\p"
	.string "other battle permissions remain\n"
	.string "active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_ExplainBulkUp:: @ 81753BF
	.string "That TM08 contains BULK UP.\p"
	.string "It's a move that raises both ATTACK\n"
	.string "and DEFENSE stats.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPostBattle:: @ 8175412
	.string "You have the KNUCKLE KEY. Keep\n"
	.string "seeking the remaining guardians.\p"
	.string "The gate home needs all eight.\n"
	.string "Your partner is your anchor; do\p"
	.string "not lose hope.$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymStatue:: @ 8175477
	.string "DEWFORD TOWN DIGIMON GYM$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:: @ 8175490
	.string "DEWFORD TOWN DIGIMON GYM\p"
	.string "BRAWLY'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
